    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d27">

                <pb facs="0101" n="67" xml:id="pg67"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">No. 27.</note>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Davis to Mr. E. B. Washburne.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1870-09-06"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 6, 1870.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>If provisional government has actual control and possession of power, and is
                    acknowledged by French people, so as to be, in point of fact, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">de facto</hi> government, of which you will be able to
                    decide by the time this reaches you, you will not hesitate to recognize it.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>DAVIS, <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
